WEBVTT

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.840
August 2018

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:12.970
A month of record-breaking high temperatures across all of Japan.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:16.550
Hm? Huh?

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:20.140
What's wrong? It's not reading the disc.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.310
It might be the hot weather.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:25.980
Or because of deterioration.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:28.360
Wh-What? What? Why?

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:28.980
No way! No way! No way! No way!

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.110
Uncle! Calm down!

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:32.400
We can fix it! We can fix it!

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:33.320
No way! No way! No way! No way! No way!

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.780
No way! No way! What? What? Why?

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.200
No way! No way! No way! No way! No way! No way! No way!

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:38.950
No way! No way! No way! No way! No way...

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:55.150
Refrain　消した記憶

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:55.150
Refrain from those lost memories​.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:01:01.440
Rely　物語の常が今見せる言葉で

00:00:55.150 --> 00:01:01.440
Rely on the words from those ordinary stories.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.660
