00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.320
Nothing's gonna make a difference.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:09.700
Don't ever lose sight of your goal​.

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:13.410
Who was the one that chose it?

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:17.840
That way of life is unlike you.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:21.090
Having the strength to pursue your goal.

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:23.340
That's what it means to be strong​.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:27.720
It's something you already knew.

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.890
I believe in what I’ve done

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.890
I believe in what I've done.

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:32.020
No reason to go back again

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:32.020
No reason to go back again.

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:36.730
Those days gone by full of precious moments.

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.610
Easy losing memories

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.610
Easy losing memories.

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.730
I'm struggling now to overcome

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.730
I'm struggling now to overcome.

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:45.410
I'm never going to give up​ until the very end​.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:47.280
Get down Let’s get down

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:47.280
Get down. Let's get down.

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:54.160
The light still shines in my heart.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.830
Trust yourself

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.830
Trust yourself.

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:58.920
Don't be naive

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:58.920
Don't be naive.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:01.130
Save yourself

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:01.130
Save yourself.

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:03.590
Don't forget

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:03.590
Don't forget.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:11.880
You two spooked me.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:14.960
The two of you covered in sweat and fidgeting with the device...

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:18.300
Thank goodness they teach you how to repair it on the web.

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:23.600
Never imagined I'd ever see a 64-bit CPU.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:26.850
The Saturn sure broke down out of nowhere.

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:28.940
It's probably the summer heat.

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:31.100
So, who wants ice cream?

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:33.310
- Me!!
- Meee!!

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:36.230
Dad and Chiaki got this while fishing.

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:38.110
The ice cream is a bonus.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:42.240
So like, can't you cool off the room with some ice magic?

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:47.000
Ooooooh!!!

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:48.620
Aaaaaah!!!

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:51.120
Suzu..! Aaaah!!!

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:51.120
Note: Suzu (涼) here means cool.

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:52.670
What a genius idea!

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.750
Thank you! Suzumiya-san!!

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:56.210
Hiyaaa!!!

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.340
Uh, who?

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:00.630
Uh, I'm more worried that neither of you thought of it.

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:03.850
Hmm... The heat might be a part of it, but...

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:07.560
Maybe it's a lingering aftereffect of being in dragon form for an hour...

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:10.810
Caring about things just feels so petty.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:11.850
I know.

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:15.020
Dragons don't have a care in the world about things like their future...

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:17.070
Oh! We could be dragons again!

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:18.820
Stop escaping to dragon form!

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:21.990
An AC. You should buy an air conditioner.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:24.870
I'd love to, but the money's not there...

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.780
And there's the electric bill...

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:29.080
Guess we need a new idea...

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:31.580
Those otherworld videos we've been watching...

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.580
How about taking the videos and posting them to YouTube as-is?

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.040
Oh, there's an idea.

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:37.380
Absolutely not.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.010
Why not?

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:42.720
Uncle, can you visualize what I'm thinking right now?

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:43.680
Let's see...

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:46.390
It's "Icuras Yuul Elran," so...

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:51.430
Memory spirit. Display what he envisions.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:03.490
The minotaur didn't even do anything,
poor guy ;_;
You made a whole spectacle out of killing
an animal... I'm shaking rn I'm so mad
Does this guy even have a hunting license?
Pretty sure that light sword length is illegal
under the Firearms and Sword Control Law
Gotta wonder if he got the siblings'
permission before filming them
Probably not
This is animal abuse. Reported.
Dude this is unedited guro, just OUT

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:05.030
This would happen, guaranteed.

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:06.820
People would write those things?

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:09.910
I would. I'd complain just for the hell of it.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:12.040
You really are big into online stuff...

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.670
So, any other magic ideas?

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:18.540
Hmm... What spirit could I get a favor from?

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:22.800
Hey... I know it's kind of late to ask, but what's the deal with these spirits anyway?

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:23.840
Hm?

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.340
You know, how they look and stuff.

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:26.260
Ah!

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:28.970
If we're talking fantasy-world spirits...

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:32.230
Dark Spirit

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:32.230
Kuroche

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:32.230
Light Spirit

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:32.230
Kilighd

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:32.180
They've gotta take the form of beautiful women, right?

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:34.390
No, they don't really have forms.

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:35.400
Huh?

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:40.440
I call them spirits, but they're more like the collective wills of phenomena and concepts.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:45.610
I just hear their voices here and there.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:47.070
Huh...

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:49.370
They... can talk, right?

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:52.790
Sure, they basically can.

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:56.870
It's like their wills sort of drift into my mind.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:57.960
They're doing it now!

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:01.300
I hear 'em... Heh-heh-heh...

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:05.130
I hear the voices of all kinds of beings...

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:10.720
Is it safe for you to converse with them like that, Uncle?

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.140
Hm, why?

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:14.140
You know, mentally...

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:16.600
Oh... Heh heh... Well...

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:19.860
You can see for yourself.

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:26.780
A cow head.

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:29.240
Let's buy a cow head.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:30.240
Huh?

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:36.040
There's a Wagyu beef cattle head online for five million yen.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:37.250
They have those!?

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.330
Five million yen, huh?

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:41.710
Wait. Hold on. Where did this come from?

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:46.470
Well, the ice spirit's demanding compensation for the cooling spell.

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:48.470
What!? You have to compensate them!?

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:49.930
Sure I do.

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:52.510
When you ask someone to do something unusual and unpleasant...

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:55.060
It's just good manners to thank them and give them a gift.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:57.190
So... Why a cow?

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:00.190
So we can make an altar and offer the head on it...

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:02.440
This is getting really weird!!

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.320
What is Uncle making a deal with here!?

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:09.530
They say if we don't, they'll freeze all the open fields on the planet for ten years.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:11.700
Ten...

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.950
Isn't that kind of overkill for compensation!?

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.450
The price for our cooling is wiping out humanity!?

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:18.040
Seems like it.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.460
My bad.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:25.380
For now, I think I'll cook one of the fish you bought for lunch.

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:29.260
This might be the last year I can enjoy a full stomach.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:35.390
Oh wow, really?

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:38.810
Right. Yes. I'll be going now.

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.480
They say they'll accept a fish head!

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.650
How little does the spirit care about humanity's continued existence!?

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:53.570
I guess to the spirit, there's not much difference between a cow and a fish.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:57.830
And humans, they probably only care if it fits the loose definition of "a living creature."

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:01.420
I doubt they'd feel any pain or agitation from wiping us out.

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:04.630
You "doubt"? How can you be so chill about this!?

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:08.130
Yeah! Humanity was just on the brink of extinction!

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.090
Maybe I'm just desensitized...

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:18.560
Pretty much every shooting games from the '90s started out with humankind being on the verge of extinction.

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:22.020
Maybe if you didn't play so many dark games...!!

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:26.020
Did game developers have something against humankind in the '90s?

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.700
Uncle!

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:35.160
It's an aftereffect from being a draco-human...

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:38.740
Raw meat and raw fish start looking awfully appetizing.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.370
- I can sympathize.
- Don't sympathize.

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:44.630
Uncle, why'd you join him as a dragon, anyway?

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:49.090
Oh... I figured Takafumi would be lonely if he was the only dragon-esque reptile.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:51.970
I thought you might never turn back!

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:54.590
I was really scared then!

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:57.640
I did feel a lot better having someone else like me there.

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.220
Wanna be a dragon, Fujimiya?

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:01.060
Ooh! It'd be even more fun with three of...

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:02.310
I don't want to!!

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:04.690
That said, you gotta watch out for that.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:07.190
When a transformation lasts too long...

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:11.070
It's possible you can become stuck that way and never revert.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:14.280
For example... Icuras Elran.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:19.700
I spent like a month as a dragon after I left that kingdom...

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:21.410
- What!?
- Why!?

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:26.420
My mind was taken over by the Blaze Dragon's thought pattern. I couldn't change back.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.630
I might've stayed a dragon for the rest of my life...

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:31.050
That's serious trouble!

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:34.300
Why'd you risk becoming a dragon, then!?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.220
Mm...

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:41.890
I just thought it'd make for a cooler exit than walking out.

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:44.060
It was pretty badass, but still...

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:46.100
How does that remotely matter?

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:49.440
So... How'd you turn back?

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:52.030
Mm... About that...

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:57.780
I finally found you.

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:15.680
The capital was in an uproar over the Prelate seeing an orc turn into a dragon.

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:18.640
It's all the people are gossiping about.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:23.890
I can see this has gotten out of hand.

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:29.020
For goodness' sake!

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:31.900
Tsundere-san!!

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:38.360
"Fell-fire" huh!!?

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:40.620
Fireproofing spellcard!!

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:44.790
Not much punch, huh?

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:47.040
You're...

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.210
A pale imitation!!

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:08.850
Y'know, I think this is the first proper fantasy-world fight I've seen so far.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:09.770
Yeah...

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:12.360
But I've been fighting plenty!

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:17.320
All your fights are either "get hanged" or "win instantly"...

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:26.290
Don't you...

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:28.500
"Rawr" at me!!

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:37.210
Stupid...!

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:39.510
You know...

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:46.430
You're just fine as an orc!

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:10.410
Well. Well. Well...

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:15.130
Rumors were abounding of an orc shifting into a giant dragon...

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:18.260
I came out with some sellswords for a hunt...

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:21.340
And here, I find it already captured by one of our very own customers!

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:22.930
The Regfalgen Company...!

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:24.470
Heh heh heh...

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:25.890
Is this fate?

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:27.930
Should you hand him over alive...

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:30.390
You'll be quite handsomely rewarded.

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:35.820
Perhaps not as handsome a sum as what you owe us.

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:40.530
Speaking of that... Will you be able to pay us back...

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:42.410
I said I'd repay it.

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:45.030
You're putting the screws to me when I'm not even in arrears?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:49.040
You'd think a company president would have more composure.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:53.750
Spoken like a true daughter of the Elga Royal Family!

00:11:55.750 --> 00:12:00.380
Truly, how fortunate I am to be graced with such wisdom in comporting myself as befits a superior.

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.930
You hear that!!? She graced us with her wisdom!

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:04.510
Record what she said for prosperity!

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:08.850
What was it, again? "Hewwo, I'm a debtor pwincess, and I'm a vewwwy big deal!"

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:10.350
Did I get that right?

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:12.140
Elf-san was a princess this whole time!?

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:13.560
Uh, yeah.

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:16.810
You know that's a huge deal, right!? She's royalty! An actual, bona fide princess!

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:19.110
It's not quite that rare, you know...

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:24.110
Valgar was a prince, and Serena was descended from royalty too.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:21.490
Note: Reinhart Valgar from Guardian Heroes.

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:26.370
We know you're talking about a video game there!

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:28.950
- What's your point?
- That is the point!

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:31.120
You did your research on me, huh?

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:34.330
We research all our largest customers, prin—

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:36.080
Don't call me "princess."

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:39.710
It might be in your best interest to start actin' nice.

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:42.420
Pri—n—ce—ss.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:54.520
My, my. None of that now, Lady Elf.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:59.060
This is a dark pactcard. We made a blood pact in the name of the spirits.

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:01.530
No violence is allowed between contract parties.

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:07.240
You have two choices, either pay off your debt and be released or go into arrears and be mine.

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:11.450
You were a bit careless in offering yourself up for collateral.

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:17.170
A martial connection to elven royalty is sure to open new doors for the company.

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:21.750
The name Hagen Regfalgen will become known throughout—

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:24.130
Kurochelgid Riolran.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:27.510
Oh...

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:32.010
You snapped me out of the dragon-shift, didn't you?

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:34.140
Y-Yeah. Hi again.

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.690
I dunno what's going on...

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:38.730
But I just returned the favor, right?

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:40.190
Uh?

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:42.400
Bye.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:44.400
Hold it right there!

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:45.650
Oh, for...!

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:47.990
Why are you like this!?

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:50.910
Uh, you might not wanna touch me. It's been too long.

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:51.910
A month!

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:54.120
I haven't had a bath for a whole month...

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.040
You don't smell funny, okay?

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:58.210
You haven't smelled me up close.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:00.330
I did while you were sleeping, actually!

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:03.800
What? Why?

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:07.800
N-Not like that! It wasn't intentional! I was hugging...

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:10.510
I mean...

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:13.260
I smelled you when I was trying to strangle you...!!

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:14.640
Oof...!

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:16.230
What a strained excuse...

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:18.940
Oh, that makes sense.

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:21.730
Boy, I came this close to getting strangled to death.

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.980
That's seriously how he perceives it...

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:27.400
As usual, he and tsundere-types are like oil and water...

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:32.530
You broke the debt pact I used a spellcard to forge!?

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:35.450
M-My plans...!

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:37.080
Just who is that orc!?

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:39.580
- What the hell is your relationship!?
- What? Debt?

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:42.420
Wh-What relationship does it look like we have...!?

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.590
Oh, shut the hell up!!

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:47.170
Boss...

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:49.880
If the pact is out of the picture...

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:54.100
Can I teach the chick some manners now?

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:56.930
Doldoll the Giant Hunter!

00:14:57.020 --> 00:15:01.560
I was really lookin' forward to huntin' a dragon... This little sideshow's pissin' me off...!!

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:05.400
I deserve a little fun, y'know...?

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:06.780
- Me too!
- Yeeaaah!

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:10.860
You brought this on yourself, Lady Elf...

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:15.330
Perhaps a painful lesson might be a more suitable reminder of your place.

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:17.950
I'm not as nice to my enemies as orc-face over here.

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:20.160
Can you beat this army?

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:22.630
In the blink of an eye.

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:33.510
This is a cosmite ring. They say only seven of these exist in the world.

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:36.140
A rarity like this is worth a lot of money.

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:38.600
I don't want this...

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:41.560
I'm sorry. I didn't know she owed you money...

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:43.520
We're square, right?

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:45.770
Right? This is a token of my sentiment...

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:47.610
What...?

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:57.660
I went to all those lengths to buy it back...

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.620
Hmmmm...?

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:05.880
Scary!!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:10.300
It's gonna crumble!

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:11.720
Tch...

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:13.630
Watch out!

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:19.720
Eww! A swamp!

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:20.640
Mud!

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.230
What now, boss?

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:26.480
J... Just leave them!

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.650
Who wants an elf drenched in mud anyway!? I want nothing to do with her!

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:33.200
Damn it!!!

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:35.660
It won't come off!

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:38.780
Congrats, sir.

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:40.160
Congrats, sir.

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:43.000
Stop celebrating, you nincompoops.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:45.290
We're leaving!

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:48.130
Whoops... Guess the ring was too small for him.

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:51.920
But seriously, going into debt? What were you thinking?

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:53.720
What do you expect?

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:56.930
I didn't have enough to buy this back!

00:16:57.010 --> 00:17:00.060
Huh!? That's the ring I gave you!

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:01.970
I liquidated that for you!

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:02.890
Look...

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:05.560
Sheesh, what a waste!

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:08.360
You don't need to wear precious metals.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.320
Shut up, stupid orc!

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:13.070
You look pretty enough already.

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:18.240
...What?

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:21.450
You're drenched in mud!

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.830
Filthy orc! Mud-orc!

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:25.910
If anyone's muddy, it's you!

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:32.380
You're right.

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:38.300
You can't even tell which one of us is the orc or the elf now!

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:45.100
I've had enough of being dirty.

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:47.310
I want a hot bath today.

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:50.690
Ah... This is a volcanic area. It's got hot springs.

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:53.150
Whoa... Really? Where!?

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:54.530
That way.

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:59.490
You know, I've noticed you seem weirdly fixated on staying clean.

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:02.450
I take a bath at least once a day.

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:07.040
A seasoned adventurer could go a whole month with no baths and not complain.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:08.960
Like me...

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:14.960
Oww! That hurts! What!?

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:17.670
Anyway...

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:21.220
You see how she used violence on me, totally unprovoked...

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:22.390
He deserved that...!

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:24.640
I saw the look he gave her...!

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:28.640
I hate to admit it, but the elf played a huge part in turning me back.

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:33.900
So, the fantasy world has hot springs too, huh?

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:35.980
Oh yeah, I took a soak after that.

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:37.740
Oh, nice.

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:40.910
When it's this cold, I could go for one myself...

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:46.200
It's 10°C in August!?

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:47.250
It's way too cold!

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:49.790
Uncle, turn off the cooling spell for a while!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.000
Sure.

00:18:58.800 --> 00:18:59.970
I could open a window.

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:02.090
No... We'd better not.

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:06.560
If that rubbed the ice spirit the wrong way...

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:08.640
Mankind would perish...!!

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:13.020
Why does mankind go extinct from opening one lousy window anyway!!?

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.440
Can we buy an air conditioner? Please?

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:17.530
I'll chip in, if money's an issue.

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:20.400
No, I have my pride as a YouTuber...

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:23.120
Stay out of this, you bargaining influencer!

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:26.910
Aha! Couldn't you cut the cold air with your "Sword of Darkness" spell?

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:30.250
Hm? I don't think it works like that.

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:33.130
What if we just drop the magic and buy an AC unit already?

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:35.090
Takafumi, give me your cell.

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:36.630
Sure.

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:38.920
Spirit of darkness—

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:43.010
Become a blade and reveal thy form.

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:47.010
Look.

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:48.180
No signal.

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:51.350
Whoa! It cut both the Wi-Fi and the phone-network signal!

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:52.270
That's nuts!

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:57.820
The Sword of Darkness severs power flows, like magic or radio waves.

00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:00.740
It should be able to cut transmissions too.

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:03.450
Where's your IR port?

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:06.490
IR's a little outdated...

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.160
Bluetooth!

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:13.750
Sure, let's see the port! Where's the Bluetooth port?

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.580
There is no port for that.

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:18.920
Oh, I get it! It's related to blu-rays, right?

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.130
Not at all! Ah ha ha ha ha!

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:26.390
In a frigid room amid the sweltering August heat...

00:20:26.470 --> 00:20:30.140
It was surprisingly fun huddling and chatting under a blanket.

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:33.310
Summer this year is a fish every day.

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:56.750
The shadow stretches further away with a goodbye.

00:20:56.750 --> 00:21:00.470
Why do you never notice it?

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:06.560
I've been looking towards you all this time.

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:18.650
All these personal feelings looking for a place to go​.

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:24.820
A brush of orange gently ​painted the sky.

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:33.160
Let it ring! ​Making a wish upon those tiny stars.

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:39.710
Yearning to light up the sky far, far away.

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:44.340
Wishing to get it through, but not getting through.

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:48.100
Turning this feeling of love.

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:51.810
Into an everlasting star.

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:56.610
Shining only for you​.

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:06.610
It's awful.

00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:09.070
A parasite monster...

00:22:09.570 --> 00:22:11.700
Must've gotten it from a river fish or something.

00:22:11.780 --> 00:22:13.240
How awful...

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:16.040
I didn't know a stomach could do that...

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:17.160
Urk...

00:22:22.380 --> 00:22:23.880
Orc-face!?

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:25.760
You can't just barge into someone's room like that!

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:26.760
It's an emergency.

00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:29.130
Wha...?

00:22:30.640 --> 00:22:31.640
Hwuh?

00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:36.810
Good. Nothing there.

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:41.350
Someone got infected by a parasite monster.

00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:44.940
If you're infected, there should be a visible sign of it on the stomach.

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:47.530
Ah... I see...

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:50.660
Hey... Aaah!

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:53.160
You big, stupid dummy, let me go!

00:22:58.120 --> 00:23:01.750
I didn't even do anything!

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:02.790
As for you!

00:23:02.880 --> 00:23:04.130
Don't you dare ever...

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:12.930
Something's in my stomach—

00:23:13.010 --> 00:23:14.930
Stop the video! Stop!

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:18.140
Uncle, stop it.

00:23:21.190 --> 00:23:24.820
Now then, we were supposed to have fish for lunch.

00:23:24.900 --> 00:23:27.320
I can't. No way in hell.

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:29.820
Okay, so what's for lunch?

00:23:36.790 --> 00:23:40.910
Nyuuuuuuuuuu~
